      "summary": {
        "zh": "从张骞凿空西域到汉朝与罗马的间接贸易：一条路如何连起汉、贵霜、波斯与罗马，运送丝绸、造纸术与佛教信仰。",
        "en": "From Zhang Qian's westward missions to indirect Han–Rome trade: how one network linked Han China, Parthia, Persia and Rome, carrying silk, papermaking and Buddhism."
      },
      "seed_topic": "silk_road",
      "exploration_goals": {
        "zh": "理解丝绸之路作为跨文明网络的运作方式：张骞如何打开东西通道，汉朝技术（造纸/丝织）如何西传，佛教如何沿路东行，以及罗马如何经由中间商获得丝绸。",
        "en": "Understand the Silk Road as a cross-civilization network: how Zhang Qian opened the east-west corridor, how Han technologies (paper/silk) spread west, how Buddhism travelled east along the routes, and how Rome obtained silk through intermediaries."
      },
