    {
      "slug": "india-classical-civilization",
      "type": "official",
      "visibility": "public",
      "status": "featured",
      "title": {
        "zh": "印度文明探索包 V1",
        "en": "India Classical Civilization Package V1"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "从孔雀王朝到笈多黄金时代：佛教如何从印度出发沿丝绸之路传向世界，零与十进制如何被体系化，印度又如何与波斯、希腊、罗马同时代对话。",
        "en": "From the Maurya Empire to the Gupta Golden Age: how Buddhism set out from India along the Silk Road, how zero and the decimal system were formalized, and how India conversed with Persia, Greece and Rome."
      },
      "seed_topic": "ancient_india",
      "exploration_goals": {
        "zh": "理解印度古典文明的制度与文化演化：孔雀王朝的统一（旃陀罗笈多/阿育王）与阿育王转向佛教、正法（Dharma）思想的确立、笈多时代的古典黄金期（迦梨陀娑、阿耶波多、零的体系化），并重点追踪佛教沿丝绸之路传播至汉朝的跨文明连接。",
        "en": "Understand the institutional and cultural evolution of classical India: the unification under the Mauryas (Chandragupta/Ashoka) and Ashoka's turn to Buddhism, the establishment of Dharma thought, the classical Golden Age of the Guptas (Kalidasa, Aryabhata, the formalization of zero), and — crucially — the cross-civilization spread of Buddhism along the Silk Road into Han China."
      },
